/UTLGEN.BI  Parent:SYSGEN.V4  Subfiles:none

/Assembles OS/78 V4 system utility files (CUSPS) that are not device
/dependent. Input device is SRCE:, output device is OBJ: that are set
/by the SYSGEN.V4 subfile for the current source and object devices.
/For more information see SYSGEN.TX.

$JOB	assemble sources, create runnable images, and move to OBJ:
.PAL SRCE:SETV4
.LOAD SETV4
.SAV SYS:SET.V4 0-777,1400-7577,12000-16377,30000-33577=2100

.PAL SRCE:RXCOP4
.LOAD RXCOP4
.SAVE SYS:RXCOPY.V4;16000=7503

.PAL SRCE:HELPV4
.LOAD HELPV4
.SAVE SYS:HELP.V4;200=3501

.PAL SRCE:BATCH4
.LOAD BATCH4
.SAVE SYS:BATCH.V4;200=2501

.PAL SRCE:CREFV4
.LOAD CREFV4
.SAVE SYS:CREF.V4;200=2101

.PAL SRCE:BITMV4
.LOAD BITMV4
.SAVE SYS:BITMAP.V4;12000=6101

.PAL SRCE:PAL8V4
.LOAD PAL8V4
.SAVE SYS:PAL8.V4;200=2100

.PAL SRCE:DIREC4
.LOAD DIREC4
.SAVE SYS:DIRECT.V4;14600=6503

.PAL SRCE:FOTPV4
.LOAD FOTPV4
.SAVE SYS:FOTP.V4;14600=6503

.PAL SRCE:SRCOM4
.LOAD SRCOM4
.SAVE SYS:SRCCOM.V4;200=0100

.PAL SRCE:PIPV4
.LOAD PIPV4
.SAVE SYS PIP.V4;13000=6503

.PAL SRCE:EDITV4
.LOAD EDITV4
.SAVE SYS:EDIT.V4;200=2101

.PAL SRCE:BOOTV4
.LOAD BOOTV4
.SAVE SYS:BOOT.V4

.PAL SRCE:FUTIL4
.LOAD FUTIL4
.SAVE SYS:FUTIL.V4;6400=6503

.PAL SRCE:RTFLOP
.LOAD RTFLOP
.SAVE SYS:RTFLOP.V4 0-7577,12000-17577;200=3003

.PAL SRCE:LOG278
.LOAD LOG278
.SAVE SYS LOG.V4

/REMOVE UNNECESSARY BINARY FILES:
/.DEL *.BN

$END

